	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/><persName ref="p714">Caelius Secundus Curio</persName> S. D. per Christum Iesum.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Ego et F. <persName ref="p3018">Stancarus</persName>, qui mecum est,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. <ref target="file12851">Nr. 2802</ref>,22f.</note> superioribus diebus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>ad te literas<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p714">Curiones</persName> Brief <ref target="file12851">Nr. 2802</ref> vom 8. Februar.</note> dedimus, quibus uterque tuis<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Nicht erhalten.</note> respondebamus.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Expectabamus autem responsum,<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Diese nicht mehr erhaltene Antwort kreuzte den vorliegenden Brief, mit dem <persName ref="p3018">Stancaro</persName> erfuhr, dass <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> ihm keine Stelle vermitteln konnte; s. <ref target="file12889">Nr. 2840</ref> vom 7. März.</note> presertim quod <persName ref="p3018">Stancarus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>valde suspensus haeret de eo, quod tua humanitate ultro <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ipsius caussam<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> caussa.</note> curandum suscepisti.<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. <ref target="file12848">Nr. 2799</ref>,1-6. 17-20.</note></s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed, quia valde est <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>occupatus, non potuit hodie tibi scribere.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Rogavit autem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>me, qui alioquin ad te literas dabam, tuam humanitatem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>suo nomine salutarem rogaremque, si quid spei habeas, nobis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>primo quoque tempore significes, ut, sibi quid sit agendum, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>intelligat.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quod reliquum est, cum haberem literas in <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><placeName ref="l834">Italiam</placeName> mittere nec haberem nuntium, mi optime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>ad te eas mittere cogitavi, ut, si quo pacto <pb type="edition" next="386"/> queas, eas <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l98">Curiam</placeName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName> (<placeName ref="l648">Kt. Graubünden</placeName>).</note> ad aliquem tuum, ad d. <persName ref="p654">Comandrum</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p654">Johannes Comander</persName>.</note> aut alium, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ferendas curares, ut illinc ad Iullium nostrum <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanensem</placeName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p8079">Giulio della Rovere</persName>, über den in <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 549, Anm. 20, bereits eine Notiz vorliegt - allerdings in Zusammenhang mit einer in <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 549,26, nicht genannten Person, die mit <persName ref="p7251">Alfonso d'Avalos</persName>, dem Statthalter des Kaisers in <placeName ref="l306">Mailand</placeName>, hätte identifiziert werden sollen (richtig in <hi>Henrich, <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> BW</hi> 819, <ref target="file10965">Nr. 923</ref>).</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>qui <placeName ref="l399">Pusclave</placeName> <placeName ref="l648">Rethorum</placeName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><placeName ref="l399">Poschiavo</placeName> (<placeName ref="l648">Kt. Graubünden</placeName>).</note> evangelium docet.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Quod, ut quamprimum facias, te etiam magnopere atque <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>etiam rogo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">De novis rebus multa quotidie, imo <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>singulis horis (ut in magnis calamitatibus fieri solet) nuntian<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tur et varia, adeo ut, quid credas, vix scire <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>possis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Alii enim dicunt <placeName ref="l513">Ulmę</placeName> duobus in templis iam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>missas celebrari,<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">In der Dominikanerkirche (Predigerkloster; s. <ref target="file12861">Nr. 2812</ref>,7-10; <bibl source="b230">Fischer, Chronik</bibl> 130) sowie im Münster (s. <hi>Keim, <placeName ref="l513">Ulm</placeName> 395).</hi> -Vgl. auch Nr. 2821,52-54.</note> <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> tumultum exhortum inter <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>caesareanos <placeName ref="l18">Augustanosque</placeName> milites esse; cardinalem <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><placeName ref="l18">Augustanum</placeName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p7840">Otto Truchsess von Waldburg</persName>. - Zu dessen Entschädigungsforderungen s. <hi>Roth, <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName></hi> IV 16-21.</note>, <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandum</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">König <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinand I.</persName> - Die Verhandlungen über dessen Entschädigung zogen sich bis Ende Mai 1547 hin; s. <hi>Roth, <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName></hi> IV 21-25.</note> cęsaremque<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> ingentem pecunię <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>vim postulare; <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandum</persName> militem magnum colligere, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ut eo Mauritio<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Herzog <persName ref="p18250">Moritz von Sachsen</persName>. - Am 25. Februar 1547 kam <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinand</persName> mit 2000 Reitern in <placeName ref="l1567">Pirna (Sachsen)</placeName> an und zog dann bis <placeName ref="l1682">Meißen</placeName>, wo er noch Anfang März lag; s. <hi><persName ref="p18250">Moritz von Sachsen</persName> PK</hi> III 18.</note> suppetias ferat; et demum omnia <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>misera esse!</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Alii caesarem in <placeName ref="l640">Flandriam</placeName> cogitare, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>nescio quid in <placeName ref="l20">Inferiori Germania</placeName> tum a <persName ref="p20225">Gallo</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName></note> tum <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>a <persName ref="p3590">lantgravio Hessorum</persName><note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName>.</note> timens et subodorant<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>es<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> subodorans.</note>; <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandum</persName> propter <persName ref="p18593">Turci</persName><note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">7 Sultan <persName ref="p18593">Suleiman I.</persName></note> adventantem fugam adornare;<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Ein falsches Gerücht. - Zu den Abwehrmaßnahmen, die <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinand</persName> im Januar und Februar 1547 von <placeName ref="l396">Prag</placeName> aus gegen die <placeName ref="l2510">Türken</placeName> ergriff, s. Johann <hi>Loserth.</hi> Innerösterreich und die militärischen Maßnahmen gegen die Türken im 16. Jahrhundert. Studien zur Geschichte der Landesdefension und der Reichshilfe, Graz 1934. S. 50.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>et alia id genus multa, quę dominus vertat bene!</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Hoc autem certum est, nec dubito te id accepisse: <placeName ref="l491">Argento<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ratenses</placeName> legatos ad caesarem de pace misisse.<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Siehe dazu <ref target="file12871">Nr. 2822</ref>, Anm. 16.</note></s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Nundum<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">= Nondum; s. <bibl source="b616">Stotz</bibl> III 51, Nr. 39.8.</note> auditos esse propter <persName ref="p7706">Granvelani</persName><note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21"><persName ref="p7706">Nicolas de Perrenot, Herr von Granvelle</persName>, der damals nach <placeName ref="l631">Burgund</placeName> gereist war; s. <ref target="file12871">Nr. 2822</ref>, Anm. 10.</note> absentiam, et <lb xml:id="p1z35"/><persName ref="p7689">Naves</persName> mortem, qui dum <placeName ref="l18">Augustam</placeName> cum copiis proficisceretur, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>in itinere interiit.<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="22">Vgl. auch <ref target="file12870">Nr. 2821</ref>.89-92. - <persName ref="p7689">Johann von Naves</persName> starb am 20. Februar; s. <ref target="file12873">Nr. 2824</ref>, Anm. 5.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Sed si tu certiora habes, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>rogo, ad nos aliquid scribas, tuumque de nostro libello<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23">Siehe dazu <ref target="file12807">Nr. 2758</ref>, Anm. 9.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>iudicium audire valde cupio, mi optime et doctissime <persName ref="p495">Henrice</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>semper<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> sempe.</note> amantissime et observandissime.<pb type="edition" next="387"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale et familiam <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>meo nomine saluta tuam et una fratres istos doctissimos.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName>, die 4. martii 1547.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/><persName ref="p714">Caelius</persName>, ex animo tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo doctrina et <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>pietate viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, antistiti <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>vigilantissimo, amico <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et fratri observandissimo.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>